\id 2TH  
\h 2 Tetsarunikatari 
\toc1 Xapa hutarieka mieme Papuru kemɨtiwarunɨ'airi tetsarunikatari 
\toc2 2 Tetsarunikatari 
\toc3 2Tets 
\mt2 Xapa hutarieka mieme Papuru kemɨtiwarunɨ'airi  
\mt1 Tetsarunikatari  
\c 1  
\s1 Waɨritsika  
\p
\v 1 Papuru, Tsiriwanu meta Timuteu,  
\b  
\p tekanixewaɨritɨaka tetsarunikatari xemɨyutixexeɨriwa Kakaɨyari mɨta'ukiyari hetsie xetewiyatɨ, Ti'aitame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu hetsie xetewiyatɨ.   
\b  
\p
\v 2 Kakaɨyari mɨta'ukiyari, Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu mɨti'aitame, 'aixɨa mekete'u'iyarini xehetsiemieme, mekexepitɨaka yu'iyaritsie xemɨka'uximatɨariekakɨ.   
\s1 Pamɨpariyutsi kememɨte'ipitɨaka meta nenewieri  
\p
\v 3 Neuxei 'iwamarixi, kaneuyeweka tame taheyemekɨ pamɨpariyutsi temipitɨakakɨ Kakaɨyari xehepaɨtsita, kemɨreuyewetse yatemɨteyuriekakɨ xeme keyuri xemɨte'erie xemɨtaweriyarɨmekɨ, meta yuxexuitɨ yunaitɨ xemɨtetamɨiriyarɨmekɨ xeteyukanaki'erietɨ.  
\v 4 'Ayumieme tameri 'aixɨa te'utiyuatɨ xehepaɨtsita yatekateniwakuxaxatɨwani mɨkɨ memɨyutixexeɨriwa Kakaɨyari hetsie metewiyatɨ, mɨpaɨ teteniwakɨhɨaweni, kexemɨte'uka'eniwa, yuri kexemɨte'erie mexi xetaweweiyarɨwa, mexi xe'uximatɨarie, meta naime kexemɨ'itɨarietɨwe.  
\v 5 Yaxe'itɨariekaku kanimatsiɨkɨni Kakaɨyari heitseriemekɨ kemɨti'inɨata 'itsɨkametɨtɨ, mɨpaɨ xeteta'inɨatsieme xemeta xekanimariwakakuni, xehetsie kemɨtinakeni 'axemu'uwanikɨ Kakaɨyari tixe'aitɨwametɨkaku, mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨnikɨ xetenikwineni xemeta.   
\p
\v 6 Kamɨtsɨ, Kakaɨyari heitseriemekɨ katiniyuriemɨkɨ kemɨtiwapinirieni wa'uximatɨatɨ mɨkɨ memɨxe'uximatɨa,  
\v 7 kemɨtixepinirieni xemeta xe'uxipitɨatɨ xeme xemɨ'uximatɨarie, yatati'uxipitɨatɨ tameta, kepauka matsiɨkɨtɨ mayani Ti'aitame Ketsutsi taheima 'akamietɨ, yuniuki tuayamete memɨtɨrɨkawi wahamatɨa 'akamietɨ, taipaɨ merɨkaɨyetɨ.  
\v 8 Heitseriemekɨ kaniwaranutaxɨriemɨkɨ mɨkɨ memɨka'imate Kakaɨyari, mɨkɨ yamemɨkatekahu Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi niukieya 'aixɨa manuyɨne hetsie.  
\v 9 Mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ memɨ'anene kememɨte'anutaxɨriyani, wahetsie tininakimɨkɨ memɨka'unarienikɨ yuheyemekɨ, Ti'aitame hɨxieya mekaxeiyatɨ meta tɨrɨkaɨyetɨ kemɨtimariwe meka'ixeiyatɨ  
\v 10 kepauka munuani, kaninuamɨkɨtsɨ witsimɨtixeiyarienikɨ yuteɨterima wahetsie tiwiyatɨ, yunaitɨ yuri memɨte'uta'eri memɨhɨxiyanikɨ me'i'ixɨarietɨ 'iya tukaritsie, mɨpaɨ katiniyɨmɨkɨ yuri xemɨte'ita'eririkɨ tita temɨtehekɨatakai xehetsɨa.   
\p
\v 11 Mɨpaɨ mɨtiyɨnikɨ, xehetsiemieme tekanitanenewieka taheyemekɨ, takakaɨyari mɨpaɨ mɨtixemaikakɨ xeme xe'u'uwame kemɨreuyewetse 'amuyeikanikɨ Kakaɨyari 'ita'inieyu, tepɨtanenewieta takakaɨyari yɨtɨrɨkariyakɨ meye'atɨanikɨ naime kexemɨteyuwaɨriya 'aixɨa xeteyuriekutɨ, naime kexemɨteyurie yuri xete'erietɨ.  
\v 12 Mɨpaɨ tiyɨyu, kemɨ'ane Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi mɨhɨkɨ witsikatinixeiyariemɨkɨ xehetsie tiwiyatɨ, xemeta witsixekatenixeiyariekuni hetsiena xetewiyatɨ, takakaɨyari Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyarikɨ.   
\c 2  
\s1 Matsiɨkɨtɨ kemɨrayani 'iya tewi yamɨtiyurieneni kemɨkatiheitserie  
\p
\v 1 Hikɨ 'iwamarixi, Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu kemɨtinuani hepaɨtsita meta hetsɨana ketemɨtekuxeɨriyani, mɨpaɨ tepɨtexewawirie,  
\v 2 yapauka xepɨkaheuyuyexɨrɨwani yumu'utsie meta xepɨkamamaka hipame kemɨtiyɨni niukiyarikɨ, yatɨni xewitɨ mɨpaɨ tikuxatakaku, yatɨni xapa tahetsɨa kename miemekɨ, mɨpaɨ 'ayetaineme: «Ti'aitame tukarieya paye'ari».  
\v 3 Xepɨkatepitɨaka nɨkahɨrixɨa xewitɨ xe'ukwamana, karikɨ meri hipatɨ Kakaɨyari me'aye'unietɨ mekanakɨnikuni meta matsiɨkɨme kanayuyeitɨamɨkɨ mɨkɨ tewi 'axamɨtiyuruwame, kemɨ'ane mɨka'unarieni.  
\v 4 Mɨkɨ neye'uniekamɨkɨ kanitawe'eriekamɨkɨ naime Kakaɨyari mɨtitewa meta naime mɨrayexeiyarie, yɨkɨmana kanayerɨmɨkɨ Kakaɨyari tukieyata meta Kakaɨyari puyuxatani.   
\p
\v 5 ¿Xekateha'eriwa mɨpaɨ nemɨtixe'utaxatɨakairi kepauka xehetsɨa nemeyeikakai 'akuxi?  
\v 6 Hikɨri xekatenimaika ketita mɨkatipitɨa mɨkɨ tewi, matsiɨkɨtɨ mayanikɨ tukarieya 'aye'ayuke.  
\v 7 Tita 'axamɨti'ane 'awie 'ari kanitsutɨaka yutɨrɨkariya, kaneuyeweka xeikɨari kemɨ'ane mɨka'ipitɨa manukuyani.  
\v 8 'Anakeri, matsiɨkɨtɨ kanayeimɨkɨ 'iya 'axamɨtiyuruwame, mɨkɨ Ti'aitame Ketsutsi kanimiemɨkɨ yu'iyakɨ yuteta miemekɨ meta kanika'unamɨkɨ matsiɨkɨtɨ mayuyeitɨanitsie kepauka munuanitsie.  
\v 9 Mɨkɨ 'axatiyuruwame kaninuamɨkɨ, Kauyumarie 'iparewiekaku, naimekɨ pɨtɨrɨkaɨyeni, mariweme pɨtiyurieneni meta 'inɨarite pɨtiwewieni tiyu'itaiyamekɨ.  
\v 10 Naime ketita 'axamɨti'anekɨ pɨwakwamana mɨkɨ memeuyexɨrie memɨkayuwaɨrikɨ tita yuri mɨraine memɨtanaki'erienikɨ meta mɨpaɨ mɨkɨ niukikɨ memɨtetawikweitsitɨarienikekai.  
\v 11 'Ayumieme Kakaɨyari pɨwapitɨa memɨte'irɨwiyarienikɨ, yuri memɨteta'erienikɨ 'itarikatsie,  
\v 12 mɨpaɨ mekatenikwinitɨariekuni yunaitɨ yuri memɨkate'ita'eriri tita yuri mɨraine, matsi memɨnaki'akai kemɨkatiheitserietsie.   
\s1 Kememɨte'anayexeiyarie memɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ  
\p
\v 13 Meta tame, kaneuyeweka taheyemekɨ pamɨpariyutsi temipitɨakakɨ Kakaɨyari xehepaɨtsita, 'iwamarixi Ti'aitame mɨxenaki'erie, tsutɨapai Kakaɨyari kanixe'anayexeiya xemɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ, hetsiena mieme xepatsietɨ 'Iyari kemɨtixepata meta yuri xete'erietɨ tita yuri mɨrainetsie.  
\v 14 'Ayumieme kanixe'uta'inieni tame niuki 'aixɨa manuyɨne texekuxaxatɨwakaku, Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu hepaɨ witsixe'anenetɨ xemakɨnekɨ.  
\v 15 Hikɨtsɨari, 'iwamarixi, xekeneti'uka 'aixɨa meta xepɨka'iku'e'eiriwani tita xemɨteyetuiriyarie xemɨte'uta'ɨkitɨarie niukikɨ meta xapakɨ.   
\p
\v 16 Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitutɨtɨ meta Kakaɨyari mɨta'ukiyari, kemɨ'ane mɨtatsi'utanaki'eri meta 'aixɨa mɨtiuka'iyarikɨ mɨtatsinɨtɨa yuheyeme meta mɨtatsipitɨa 'aixɨati'aneme temɨtetakwewiekakɨ,  
\v 17 mekexetuikani meta tɨrɨkariya mekexepitɨaka xe'iyaritsie, 'aixɨa xemutiyuanenikɨ meta 'aixɨa xemɨteyuriekakɨ.   
\c 3  
\s1 Nenewieri Kakaɨyari niukieya mukuxaxatsiwanikɨ  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨte 'iwamarixi, xekeneyunenewieka tahetsiemieme, Ti'aitame niukieya kwitɨwa mɨ'enierienikɨ naitsarie, mɨkuxaxatsiwanikɨ kemɨtiuyɨ xehetsɨa,  
\v 2 tameta temɨtawikweitsitɨarienikɨ mɨkɨ teɨteri yamemɨteyurie kemɨkareuyewetse, 'axamemɨte'u'iyari 'atsimemɨkatatsiyurienikɨ, yunaitɨtsietɨ yuri mepɨkate'erie.  
\v 3 Matsi Ti'aitame kemaine yakatinikamieni, mɨkɨ kanixetseiriyamɨkɨ, kanixe'ɨwiyakamɨkɨ kemɨ'ane 'axamɨtiuka'iyari 'atsimɨkaxeyurienikɨ.  
\v 4 Ti'aitame hetsie tetewiyatɨ 'ipaɨ yuri teteni'erieka xehepaɨtsita, mɨpaɨ xeteniuyurieni ketemɨte'aita, mɨpaɨ xeteniyuriekakunita.  
\v 5 Ti'aitame 'aixɨa ke'iyurieni xe'iyari Kakaɨyari hepaɨ xemɨteyukanaki'eriekakɨ meta Kɨritsitu hepaɨ xemɨte'uka'eniwanikɨ.   
\s1 Kemɨreuyewetse mɨti'uximayakakɨ  
\p
\v 6 'Iwamarixi, Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu hetsɨa temɨmiemetekɨ 'ipaɨ tetenixe'aitɨaka, xemɨwahayewakɨ yunaime ta'iwama 'amemu'uwa meyɨ'ɨraxietɨ yamekatekahutɨ ketemɨtexe'ɨkitɨa.  
\v 7 Xeme yɨkɨmana xekatenimaika kemɨreuyewetse xemɨtatsi'ɨkenikɨ tame. Xehetsɨa te'u'uwatɨ tepɨkata'ɨraxiekai.  
\v 8 Nixeime hetsɨa paa tepɨkatekwakai tekatetatuatɨ. Matsi tete'uximayatɨ teteta'uxitɨatɨ tukarikɨ tɨkarikɨ tekateni'uximayakaitɨni xeme temɨkatexe'uxitɨakakɨ nixeime.  
\v 9 Heitserie tekahexeiyatɨ tepɨkayɨakai, heitserie tekanexeiyanitɨtɨ temɨtexe'uxitɨanikɨ, peru mɨpaɨ tekateni'uximayakaitɨni matsi 'ɨkitsika tematayeitɨanikɨ, xemɨtatsi'ɨkenikɨ.  
\v 10 Mɨkɨ meta, kepauka xehetsɨa teme'uwakai mɨpaɨ tetenixe'aitɨakaitɨni: «Xɨka xewitɨ kayuwaɨriyani mɨti'uximayakakɨ, mekuxi mɨkɨ tixaɨ mɨkatikwani».   
\p
\v 11 Tepɨ'enana kename hipatɨ 'ame'u'uwa xetsata meyu'ɨraxietɨ, mekate'uximayatɨ, yakɨ xeikɨa meniukixietɨ pɨta.  
\v 12 Mɨpaɨ tepɨtewa'aitɨa mɨkɨ mɨpaɨ memɨ'anene, Ti'aitame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu hetsɨa temɨmiemetekɨ mɨpaɨ tepɨtewatuika, kayuwatɨ metitetɨ mete'uximayatɨ yu'ikwai memɨtekwanikɨ.  
\v 13 Xemeta ta'iwama, xepɨka'u'uxeni 'aixɨa xeteyurietɨ.   
\p
\v 14 Xewitɨ xɨka ka'i'enieni tita temɨte'utiyuane 'ikɨ xapatsie tete'utɨatɨ, xekenetimati 'iya, hamatɨana xepɨkayɨnɨka, 'iya mɨtewiyatsitɨarienikɨ.  
\v 15 Xepɨkateku'eriwani hepaɨtsitana xemɨteku'eriwa hepaɨ kemɨ'ane mɨxe'aye'unie hepaɨtsita, matsi xekene'imaiyani xemi'imaiya hepaɨ yu'iwa pɨta.   
\s1 'Aixɨa memɨ'itɨarienikɨ  
\p
\v 16 Matsi kemɨ'ane yu'iyaritsie mɨka'uximatɨarie Ti'aitametɨtɨ, yuheyemekɨ kexepitɨaka yu'iyaritsie xemɨka'uximatɨariekakɨ tsepa naimekɨ. Ti'aitame yunaime xehamatɨa ke'uyeikani.   
\p
\v 17 Ne Papuru nekanixewaɨritɨaka nemamakɨ neti'utɨatɨ. 'Ikɨ kanine'inɨaritɨni naime xapatsie, 'ipaɨ nepɨtiu'utɨa.   
\p
\v 18 Tati'aitɨwame Ketsutsi Kɨritsitu 'aixɨa ketiuka'iyarini yunaime xehetsiemieme. Mɨpaɨ xeikɨa kani'aneni.   